
                           Other Terminal Packages

Since most people don't log onto just one BBS, there is a button on the main
panel labelled 'Regular Terminal Package'. This is used to start a regular
term package like JRComm, ACCESS or VLT. To set this up all you need to do
when offered with the 'Select Terminal Package' requester is to keep
selecting the directories until you have located the program. Now just
click on the program and select OK. 

This will save it and actually start running the Terminal package for you.
